{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2022-06-03 19:21:00', 'title': 'KEURIG DR PEPPER, VICI PROPERTIES AND ON SEMICONDUCTOR SET TO JOIN S&P 500; OTHERS TO JOIN S&P MIDCAP 400, AND S&P SMALLCAP 600', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JUNE 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P DOW JONES INDICES ("S&P DJI") WILL MAKE THE FOLLOWING CHANGES TO THE S&P 500, S&P MIDCAP 400 AND S&P SMALLCAP 600 INDICES: VICI PROPERTIES INC. (NYSE:VICI) WILL REPLACE CERNER CORP. (NASD: CERN) IN THE S&P 500 PRIOR TO THE OPEN OF TRADING ON WEDNESDAY, JUNE 8. S&P 500 CONSTITUENT ORACLE CORP. (NYSE:ORCL) IS ACQUIRING CERNER IN A DEAL EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED SOON.'}